**2 [[Shadow Boxer K]]s spawn after 20 seconds<sup>600f</sup>, delay 46.67~53.33 seconds<sup>1,400f~1,600f</sup>.
**1 [[Ancient Magamojoe]] spawns after 40 seconds<sup>1,200f</sup>.
**4 [[Relic Doge]]s spawn, delay 33.33~40 seconds<sup>1,000f~1,200f</sup>.

